NimbyTack (Tack) - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.
Defines four Paper subclasses and six user actions on the vanilla DayZ 1.30 action framework
(Bohemia Interactive); depends on NimbyNotes (Scrawl) from the same pack; no third-party mod code.

Changes, newest first.
- October 20, 2026 (Tack plan v0.12, T-013/T-014 study Part B, branch study/tack-t013-t014):
  - NIMBY-T-013: new config key roughSurfaceOffsetMeters (default 0.06, clamped 5 mm to 20 cm).
    A surface on the rough-material code list (NimbyTackRules.IsRoughSurface, starting with
    dz\data_takistan\data\penetration\mud_brick.bisurf, matched without regard to case or
